---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import EditionHeader from '../components/EditionHeader.astro'; import EditionFooter from '../components/EditionFooter.astro'; import { getLatestEdition } from '../lib/content'; const edition = getLatestEdition();
---
<BaseLayout title="Editorial policy" canonical="/editorial-policy"><EditionHeader date={edition.date} count={edition.stories.length} /><main id="main" class="article"><p class="eyebrow">Editorial policy</p><h1>Evidence before prose</h1><div class="article-body"><p>Authoritative security facts retain their source and observation date. CVSS, EPSS, KEV membership, confirmed exploitation, and public proof of concept status remain separate claims.</p><p>Automation may summarize validated evidence. It cannot create or overwrite vulnerability identifiers, scores, affected versions, fixed versions, exploitation claims, or source URLs.</p><p>This preview combines a historical advisory example with clearly synthetic layout scenarios.</p></div></main><EditionFooter /></BaseLayout>
